  {
   "id": 668994,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"1\" start=\"6\">\n    <li>The graph below represents a function, <span data-math=\"f\">f</span>, which gives the height of a drone, in meters, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> seconds after it leaves the ground. Which statement describes the point <span data-math=\"f(2)=4\">f(2)=4</span>?</li>\n</ol><img alt=\"Graph. Horizontal axis, 0 to 8, time, seconds. Vertical axis, height, meters. Starting at 0 comma 0, the graph increases linearly. From 2 to 6, it’s horizontal. Then decreases linearly to 7 comma 0.\" src=\"exercises/media/d9ec50886cfda3d6.svg\">",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1333667,
     "content_html": "The height of the drone after 4 seconds is 2 meters off the ground."
    },
    {
     "id": 1333668,
     "content_html": "The height of the drone after 2 seconds is 4 meters off the ground."
    }
   ],
